<title>USA: Callaway raises qtly payout.</title>
<headline>Callaway raises qtly payout.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, Calif. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Callaway Golf Co Wednesday said its board of directors approved a quarterly cash dividend policy of $0.07 a share, an increase of 17 percent.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable February 25, to shareholders of record on February.</p>
